WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.540
But what took place is totally unacceptable.

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:04.880
The U.N. is supposed to stop invasions,

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:08.400
not create them, and not finance them.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.520
In the United States, we reject the idea

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:12.840
that mass numbers of people from foreign lands

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.200
can be permitted to travel halfway around the world,

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.440
trample our borders, violate our sovereignty,

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:20.719
cause unmitigated crime,

00:00:20.719 --> 00:00:23.600
and deplete our social safety net.

